WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.210
Revelation 20 speaks of a thousand years. Christians read it in three main ways.

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:15.900
Some say Christ returns first, and then the thousand-year reign begins.

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:26.630
Others say the church spreads goodness for a long time, and Christ returns afterwards.

00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:39.260
And others say the thousand years describe the present age, in which faithful people already reign with Christ in a hidden way.
